member.summary:
Allows the user to specify a list of columns which will not cause a change in dirty state 
for those columns if data within those columns is changed.  These columns will, in effect, 
be ignored when SaveChanges is called.

Sets up this reader such that calls to MoveNextFilter()
will position this recordset on matching rows
Ex:  If this is an imprv_detail reader, and you want rows within a specific improvement,
columnNames would be { "prop_val_yr", "sup_num", "sale_id", "prop_id", "imprv_id" }
values would be { int, int, int, int, int }
